  "description": "Optional AI-assisted moderation add-on for the Digital Wonderlab community suite (DigitalWonderlab.CommunityForum and DigitalWonderlab.CommunityComments). Layers an AI spam/toxicity review on top of the shared rules engine via the official Umbraco.AI layer (provider-agnostic; the site owner brings their own connection/profile), covering forum posts and page comments with one toggle. No add-on = the suite still moderates with the deterministic rules engine. Free to use.",
